  "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">ABOUT</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Alpha version, please share feedback in comments</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/7Bpencil/SPT.TransparentSights/refs/heads/master/previews/eotech.png\" alt=\"\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/7Bpencil/SPT.TransparentSights/refs/heads/master/previews/acro.png\" alt=\"\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/7Bpencil/SPT.TransparentSights/refs/heads/master/previews/romeo.png\" alt=\"\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">FAQ</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><ol>\n<li>My scope does not become transparent\n<ul>\n<li>Open scope stat card and switch <code>TRANSP: OFF</code> to <code>TRANSP: ON</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>I dislike blur, how can I disable it?\n<ul>\n<li>Open F12 menu and untick <code>Depth of Field/Enabled</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>I like blur, how can I make it more blurry?\n<ul>\n<li>Open F12 menu and set <code>Depth of Field/maxBlurSize</code> to higher value</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>How do I make entire weapon transparent?\n<ul>\n<li>Open F12 menu and tick <code>Make entire weapon transparent</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div></div>\n",
